# Go build output
*.exe

# androidbench/bin holds ~52 MB of cross-compiled binaries, rebuilt by
# scripts/build-android-harness.sh, plus a copy of Multipaz's prebuilt libzkp.so.
# The .so especially must never be committed: #724 constraint 1 is that no
# prebuilt binary enters the repo or the module graph, and it is not ours.
#
# androidbench/results is NOT ignored -- those CSVs are the measurement record
# behind the figures, the same way memprofile/results is tracked.
androidbench/bin/

# The release tarball package-android-libs.sh produces. It ships as a RELEASE
# ASSET on this repository, never in the tree: a .a in git would put a prebuilt
# binary in the repo, which is exactly what #724 constraint 1 forbids.
androidbench/dist/

# Circuits written by scripts/generate-circuits.sh. They are build output of the
# pinned library, regenerated in seconds, and committing them would put the same
# prebuilt artefact in the tree that constraint 1 keeps out of it. CI caches them
# instead, keyed on the longfellow-zk ref and the patches applied to it.
build/
